{"id":"00372","root":"uni00372_1","name":{"ja":"鬼崎　きらら","en":"Onisaki Kirara"},"title":{"ja":"【バニー先輩】","en":"【Bunny Senpai】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【バニー先輩】 鬼崎　きらら","en":"【Bunny Senpai】 Onisaki Kirara"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Oni","Taimanin"],"release":"2020-08-31","limited":false,"characterId":150,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。五車学園三年。鬼族と人間のハーフ。高位鬼族(霜の鬼神)の母から冷気を操る力を、父の対魔忍の血からは忍法を操るハイブリッド対魔忍。ただし彼女は父との確執から忍法の使用を封じており、彼女がどんな忍法を使うのか知るものはいない。普通の鬼族と違い、頭の角が横に生えている。これは彼女の母である鬼族の特徴であるが、幼い時からのコンプレックス（＝人間ではない）のため、普段は大きなリボンともさもさのツインテールで隠している。一見すると普通の美女寄りの美少女。男は全員ケダモノと思っていて、基本的に嫌い。母親譲りの冷気の操る力は強力で、彼女は一瞬で空気中の水分を凍結させて氷の盾としたり、冷気を纏った凍てつく拳で敵を攻撃し、凍結させたりする超接近戦闘型。母親は彼女が少女時代に父親に殺されており、それが父娘の確執の原因である。","en":"Onisaki Kirara is a Taimanin in her third year at Gosha Academy. She is a half-demon, half-human hybrid: her mother, a high-rank frost demon god, granted her the ability to control cold, while her father's Taimanin blood gave her ninja techniques. However, due to a rift with her father, she has sealed away her ninja abilities, and no one knows what ninjutsu she might use. Unlike ordinary demons, her horns grow sideways—a trait from her mother's side—but she hides them beneath a large ribbon and shaggy twin-tails to mask her lifelong complex of not being fully human. At first glance she appears as a typical beautiful young girl. She regards all men as beasts and generally dislikes them. Inherited from her mother, her cold manipulation is formidable: she can instantly freeze moisture in the air to form ice shields, or strike with frost-clad fists that freeze enemies, making her a close-quarters combat specialist. Her mother was killed by her father when Kirara was still a girl, which sparked the father-daughter conflict."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"白瀬ほなみ","forms":[{"id":"uni00372_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1266,2532],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[172,344],"def":[133,266],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42